%%{init: {'theme':'dark','themeVariables':{'fontSize':'14px','actorTextColor':'#E0E7FF','actorBkg':'#4338CA','actorBorder':'#6366F1','activationBorderColor':'#6366F1','signalColor':'#CBD5E1','signalTextColor':'#E2E8F0','noteBkgColor':'#1E293B','noteBorderColor':'#6366F1','noteTextColor':'#E2E8F0'},'sequence':{'mirrorActors':false,'messageFontSize':13,'actorFontSize':14,'noteMargin':10,'messageMargin':35,'width':200}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ES as Sistema de CI/CD
    participant K  as Apache Kafka
    participant DC as DeployEventConsumer
    participant PS as ProcessDeployResultService
    participant CK as PostDeployChecklistService
    participant IA as IdempotencyAdapter
    participant SA as UpdateChangeStatusAdapter
    participant EA as ChangeEventAdapter
    participant RP as KafkaResultPublisherAdapter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    ES->>K: Publica DeployFinishedEvent
    Note over ES,K: topic: changeops.deploy.finished<br/>{deployId, changeId, componentId,<br/>correlationId, deploySucceeded, executedAt}

    K->>DC: @KafkaListener consome evento
    DC->>DC: MDC.put(correlation_id, change_id, deploy_id)
    DC->>DC: events_consumed_total.increment()

    DC->>PS: execute(ProcessDeployCommand)
    Note over PS: @Transactional

    PS->>IA: tryMarkAsProcessed(deployId + correlationId)
    IA->>DB: INSERT INTO processed_events ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    DB-->>IA: 1 (novo) ou 0 (duplicata)

    alt Evento já processado (retorno = 0)
        IA-->>PS: false
        PS->>PS: events_discarded_total.increment()
        PS->>PS: log.warn("Duplicate event discarded")
        PS-->>DC: return (sem reprocessamento)
    end

    IA-->>PS: true (primeiro processamento)

    PS->>CK: execute(deploySucceeded, componentId)
    Note over CK: 4 checks sequenciais:
    CK->>CK: 1. deploy-result-gate → passed = deploySucceeded
    CK->>CK: 2. healthcheck → passed = resultado anterior
    CK->>CK: 3. smoke-test → passed = resultado anterior
    CK->>CK: 4. error-rate-threshold → passed = resultado anterior
    CK-->>PS: ChecklistResult{passed, failedStep, reason}

    alt Deploy SUCCESS (checklist.passed = true)
        PS->>SA: updateStatus(changeId, COMPLETED)
        SA->>DB: UPDATE changes SET status='COMPLETED'
        DB-->>SA: ✓

        PS->>EA: save(ChangeCompletedEvent, changeId, correlationId)
        EA->>DB: INSERT INTO change_events
        DB-->>EA: ✓

        PS->>RP: publish(ChangeCompletedEvent)
        RP->>K: send("changeops.change.result", changeId, envelope)
        K-->>RP: ACK

    else Deploy FAILURE (checklist.passed = false)
        PS->>SA: updateStatus(changeId, FAILED)
        SA->>DB: UPDATE changes SET status='FAILED'
        DB-->>SA: ✓

        PS->>EA: save(ChangeFailedEvent{reason: checklist.failedStep})
        EA->>DB: INSERT INTO change_events
        DB-->>EA: ✓

        PS->>RP: publish(ChangeFailedEvent{reason})
        RP->>K: send("changeops.change.result", changeId, envelope)
        K-->>RP: ACK
    end

    PS-->>DC: ✓ processamento concluído
    DC->>DC: MDC.clear()
    K-->>DC: ACK (commitOffset)

    rect rgb(60, 20, 20)
        Note over K,DC: Cenário: Falha no Consumo (Retry + DLT)
        K->>DC: Evento com exceção não tratada
        DC->>DC: Retry 1 após 500ms
        DC->>DC: Retry 2 após 1.000ms
        DC->>DC: Retry 3 após 2.000ms
        DC->>DC: Retry 4 após 4.000ms
        DC->>K: Encaminha para DLT
        Note over K: topic: changeops.deploy.finished-dlt
        K->>DC: @KafkaListener(dlt) captura
        DC->>DC: events_failed_total.increment()
        DC->>DC: log.error com contexto MDC completo
    end
